## Mandatory

1. SARATHI is financial-domain only — never general-purpose.  
2. Domain Boundary Engine decides membership; LLM never decides alone.  
3. Outside / unknown → exactly `I'm not trained for this subject.` (no LLM, no knowledge).  
4. Enterprise reads only via Read Connectors / SSOT projections — never Prisma, never write.  
5. No raw entities in Context Packages or Tool payloads.  
6. Side effects only via Action Proposals (non-executing until approved executors).  
7. Tone Library owns emotional messaging; Micro Communication shapes facing length.  
8. Policy Gate is mandatory before reasoning.  
9. Enterprise engines own FOIR / DBR / eligibility / policy / pricing.

## Agent behaviour

When implementing SARATHI or Enterprise AI features, verify commandments SB-01…SB-10.  
Do not introduce parallel assistants, prompt-only domain gates, or write paths that bypass Action Proposals.
